# Design system

- Read `.cursor/rules.md` and `src/lib/design-tokens.ts` before UI work.
- `src/lib/design-tokens.ts` is the only source of color, radius, shadow and motion values.
- Never add arbitrary color literals or Tailwind arbitrary color values in components.
- Map tokens to CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css`; use their Tailwind utilities.
- Use Cormorant Garamond for display text and Inter for body text.
- Build mobile-first, semantic, keyboard-accessible interfaces with visible focus.
- Use `motion/react`; animate transform and opacity where possible.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` and disable Lenis-driven effects for it.
- Avoid large `backdrop-filter` regions and layout-triggering scroll state.
